# Upstream Qt leak, not ours: creating and destroying a single
# RectangularShadow with no Loom involvement leaks 2093 bytes from
# QQuickShaderEffect internals (reproduced against system Qt 6.11.1 with a
# 12-line pure-Qt program; identical byte count to the loom test failures).
# Scoped to the one Qt module Loom touches only for shadow-*; every other
# leak, including anything reached through QtQuick or QtQml frames, still
# fails the sanitizer job.
leak:libQt6QuickEffects
